OL,3,GNEWSAEngine fault behind Royal Navy
OL,4,Ahelicopter death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA helicopter engine fault was one
OL,7,Ffactor behind the death of a Royal Navy
OL,8,Fserviceman during a training exercise,
OL,9,Fan investigation has concluded.
OL,11,FOn 4 September 2024, three crew members
OL,12,Fwere on board the Merlin Mk4, based at
OL,13,FRoyal Naval Air Station (RNAS)
OL,14,FYeovilton in Somerset, for night-flying
OL,15,Fexercises.
OL,17,FAt about 20:50 GMT the aircraft ditched
OL,18,F- a deliberate emergency landing on
OL,19,Fwater, approximately 25 nautical miles
OL,20,Fsouth of Lyme Regis, Dorset.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
